@startuml

title IDS Platform - Use Case Diagram

actor Attacker
actor Defender
actor System

Attacker -- (Login)
Attacker -- (Logout)
Attacker -- (Network Scan)
Attacker -- (Get Interfaces)
Attacker -- (Network Info)
Attacker -- (ARP Spoof Start)
Attacker -- (ARP Spoof Stop)
Attacker -- (SYN Flood Start)
Attacker -- (SYN Flood Stop)
Attacker -- (Attack Stats)
Attacker -- (Sniff Start)
Attacker -- (Sniff Stop)
Attacker -- (Get Packets)

Defender -- (Login)
Defender -- (Logout)
Defender -- (Start IDS)
Defender -- (Stop IDS)
Defender -- (IDS Status)
Defender -- (Discover Nodes)
Defender -- (IDS Overview)
Defender -- (View Alerts)
Defender -- (Ack Alert)
Defender -- (Block IP)
Defender -- (View Blocked)

System -- (Detect ARP)
System -- (Detect SYN)
System -- (Detect PortScan)
System -- (ID Attacker)
System -- (Generate Alert)
System -- (Log Events)

(Network Scan) ..> (ID Attacker) : triggers
(ARP Spoof Start) ..> (Detect ARP) : triggers
(SYN Flood Start) ..> (Detect SYN) : triggers
(Network Scan) ..> (Detect PortScan) : triggers

(Detect ARP) ..> (Generate Alert) : produces
(Detect SYN) ..> (Generate Alert) : produces
(Detect PortScan) ..> (Generate Alert) : produces
(ID Attacker) ..> (Generate Alert) : enriches

(Generate Alert) ..> (View Alerts) : feeds
(View Alerts) ..> (Ack Alert) : enables
(Ack Alert) ..> (Block IP) : triggers

(Detect ARP) ..> (Log Events) : records
(Detect SYN) ..> (Log Events) : records
(Detect PortScan) ..> (Log Events) : records
(Block IP) ..> (Log Events) : records

(Start IDS) ..> (Discover Nodes) : initializes
(Discover Nodes) ..> (IDS Overview) : provides data
(IDS Status) ..> (IDS Overview) : reflects

@enduml
